WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.600
H-Help me!

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.950
<i>Bakeries were looted and
moneylenders were beaten.</i>

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.380
<i>With the rule of the nobility failing and
heavy taxes imposed one after another,</i>

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.340
<i>Paris was plunged into turmoil.</i>

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.040
<i>Things were clearly foretelling
the coming of a new era.</i>

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:34.000
<i>However, the younger generation, unable to wait
for time to take its course, resorted to terrorism.</i>

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.460
<i>The French Guards Company B was ordered
to patrol Paris on special alert, day after day.</i>

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:44.880
<i>It had almost been a month
since Oscar had left her post...</i>

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.370
<i>...as Regiment Commander of the Royal Guards,</i>

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.030
<i>and became the Company Commander
of the French Guards.</i>

